2026-10-20 03:36:04,674 [INFO]     still apply; NO trail/SMA8). One trade per event: deduped on the 5m bar ts,
2026-10-20 03:36:04,674 [INFO]     so the next entry needs a fresh qualifying cross. check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
