2026-10-20 03:36:04,685 [INFO]          push/pop deletes and recreates every modified tracked file, including
2026-10-20 03:36:04,685 [INFO]          the log being written. The plain FileHandler held its fd on the old
2026-10-20 03:36:04,685 [INFO]          inode, so all later lines went to an orphaned inode. This is why the
2026-10-20 03:36:04,686 [INFO]          "check the Thursday log" instructions left for EXP2W / EXP12-relax /
2026-10-20 03:36:04,686 [INFO]          Upstox were all uncheckable. Real record was ~/orion_*_run.log (stdout).
